# >>> paster v1 >>>
# Tabbed drop-down prompt picker (Guake-style) — see __PASTER_DIR__/README.md
# Settings live in __PASTER_DIR__/config.yaml — re-run install.sh after edits.
# To change the hotkey: set it there, or re-run __PASTER_DIR__/install.sh '<key>'
# Geometry is applied by bin/toggle.sh per-toggle (focused output aware).
for_window [class="Paster"] floating enable, sticky enable, border pixel __PASTER_BORDER__
bindsym __PASTER_KEY__ exec --no-startup-id __PASTER_DIR__/bin/toggle.sh
# <<< paster v1 <<<
